        "description": "<div id=\"link_wrapped_content\">\n<body><section class=\"wp-block-bigbite-multi-title\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section>\n\n\n\n<p>I write about cables, docks, peripherals, laptops, and all sorts of PC gadgets. Every day, random items wash up onto my desk, like a shipwreck after a storm. De-cluttering my desk is a priority\u2026if only!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Part of my problem is my setup. My father owned an antique rolltop desk, and I decided I wanted one too, full of nooks and crannies and drawers to store cables and pens and all sort of little geeky knickknacks. The problem is that those desks don\u2019t really work with what I\u2019d <em>like</em> to do: organize my desk space using the accessories below.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>My plan right now is to possibly invest in a new workspace for my office, including the stylish, functional desk at the end of my list. But I\u2019ll need to build it out with the necessary accessories to neaten, straighten, and de-clutter. This is my potential shopping list. Hopefully, it benefits you",
